    "Gemini 2.5 Flash: ai.google.dev list price as of 2026-11-01 (text input, standard tier). Gemini 3.5 Flash is no longer on that page; 1.50 / 9.00 come from Google's 3.6 announcement and a Google Cloud table (the Vertex table says 2.50 output — it disagreed). Verify, then add a row with a later effectiveFrom. Gemini has no cache-write fee, so cacheWrite = 0; cacheRead for 3.5 is assumed 10% of input.",
